*** Keywords ***

Verify_Short_Link_Break_9andHalfS_2links_primary_secondary
    [Documentation]
    ...    The purpose of this test case is veryfication if RF L3 transport layer is resilient to short links breaks.
    ...    The system should avoid unneeded fault 10 or 1806 for RU and also should be able to recover without resets.
    ...    The main steps of the test case are:
    ...        1) Disconnect both optical links for 9.5s, reconnect, check L3 call and unwanted faults
    ...        2) Disconnect primary optical link for 9.5s, reconnect, check L3 call and unwanted faults
    ...        3) Disconnect secondary optical link for 9.5s, reconnect, check L3 call and unwanted faults
    ...    ARGS:
    ...    :param int primary_module_number: (Mandatory): Switch module number serving the primary optical link
    ...    :param int secondary_module_number: (Mandatory): Switch module number serving the secondary optical link
    ...    :param int primary_output_channel: (Optional): Module output channel serving primary RU-BB optical connection, defaults to 1
    ...    :param int secondary_output_channel: (Optional): Module output channel serving secondary RU-BB optical connection, defaults to 1
    ...    :param int primary_optical_switch_id: (Optional): Optical switch index serving primary link in the tesline init file, defaults to 0
    ...    :param int secondary_optical_switch_id: (Optional): Optical switch index serving secondary link in the tesline init file, defaults to 0
    ...    :param dict throughputs: throughput and deviation values for each cell identified by it's nrCellIdentity for NR cells,
    ...         eutranCellId for LTE cells, wnCelId for WCDMA cells; defaults to ${None} (L3 call will not be executed).
    ...         Example:
    ...                 { '827736065':
    ...                     { 'throughput':
    ...                         {'downlink': '100 Mbits/sec',
    ...                          'uplink': '15 Mbits/sec' },
    ...                         'deviation': '90%' }, }
    ...     :param str protocol: data transfer protocol; defaults to UDP.
    ...     :param str udp_buffer: monitoring data buffer; defaults to 4M.
    ...     :param dict ue_network_modes: (Optional): mandatory parameter for SA+NSA setups, dict with UE serial numbers and desired network modes
    ...         e.g. {"SN1234": "NR_only"} possible UE network modes: NR_only, LTE_only, NR_LTE when using more than one UE please make sure
    ...         that the modes you choose are either all with "_only" suffix or all "NR_LTE" as it is not yet possible to mix those.
    ...     :param dict ues_and_cells: (Optional): dict with UE serial numbers and lists of configuration distnames of cells to which they
    ...         can be attached e.g. {"SN1234": ["MRBTS-50146/NRBTS-1/NRCELL-1", "MRBTS-50146/NRBTS-1/NRCELL-3"], "SN5678": ["MRBTS-50146/NRBTS-1/NRCELL-5"]}
    ...         defaults to ${None} which means that all UEs will be attached to all cells. When given, listed cells will be called in pairs with specified UEs,
    ...         if there are more cells on the setup that were not mentioned in the list, they will be called with all UEs
    ...    :param list or None called_cells_distnames: CONFIGURATION distnames of cells that will be called, if not given,
    ...                                                list of all cells on testline will be determined and called

    [Arguments]                             ${primary_module_number}
    ...                                     ${secondary_module_number}
    ...                                     ${primary_output_channel}=${OPTICAL_DEFAULT_CHANNEL}
    ...                                     ${secondary_output_channel}=${OPTICAL_DEFAULT_CHANNEL}
    ...                                     ${primary_optical_switch_id}=${FIRST_OPT_SWITCH_ID_IN_INIT}
    ...                                     ${secondary_optical_switch_id}=${FIRST_OPT_SWITCH_ID_IN_INIT}
    ...                                     ${throughputs}=${None}
    ...                                     ${protocol}=udp
    ...                                     ${udp_buffer}=4M
    ...                                     ${ue_network_modes}=${None}
    ...                                     ${ues_and_cells}=${None}
    ...                                     ${called_cells_distnames}=${None}

    Robot Log Step                               Step #1: Primary and secondary links off/on
    Reset primary and secondary optical links    ${primary_module_number}
    ...                                          ${secondary_module_number}
    ...                                          ${OPTICAL_BREAK_TIME_FOR_TEST}
    ...                                          ${primary_output_channel}
    ...                                          ${secondary_output_channel}
    ...                                          ${primary_optical_switch_id}
    ...                                          ${secondary_optical_switch_id}
    Run Keyword If    ${throughputs}             Execute L3 call
    ...                                          cells_distnames=${called_cells_distnames}
    ...                                          throughputs=${throughputs}
    ...                                          protocol=${protocol}
    ...                                          udp_buffer=${udp_buffer}
    ...                                          ue_network_modes=${ue_network_modes}
    ...                                          ues_and_cells=${ues_and_cells}
    ...                                          ELSE
    ...                                          Sleep
    ...                                          ${STABILIZATION_TIME_BETWEEN_LINK_BREAKS}
    Check Detected Alarms

    Robot Log Step                               Step #2: Primary link off/on
    Reset optical link                           ${primary_module_number}
    ...                                          ${OPTICAL_BREAK_TIME_FOR_TEST}
    ...                                          ${primary_output_channel}
    ...                                          ${primary_optical_switch_id}
    Run Keyword If    ${throughputs}             Execute L3 call
    ...                                          cells_distnames=${called_cells_distnames}
    ...                                          throughputs=${throughputs}
    ...                                          protocol=${protocol}
    ...                                          udp_buffer=${udp_buffer}
    ...                                          ue_network_modes=${ue_network_modes}
    ...                                          ues_and_cells=${ues_and_cells}
    ...                                          ELSE
    ...                                          sleep
    ...                                          ${STABILIZATION_TIME_BETWEEN_LINK_BREAKS}
    Check Detected Alarms

    Robot Log Step                               Step #3: Secondary link off/on
    Reset optical link                           ${secondary_module_number}
    ...                                          ${OPTICAL_BREAK_TIME_FOR_TEST}
    ...                                          ${secondary_output_channel}
    ...                                          ${secondary_optical_switch_id}
    Run Keyword If    ${throughputs}             Execute L3 call
    ...                                          cells_distnames=${called_cells_distnames}
    ...                                          throughputs=${throughputs}
    ...                                          protocol=${protocol}
    ...                                          udp_buffer=${udp_buffer}
    ...                                          ue_network_modes=${ue_network_modes}
    ...                                          ues_and_cells=${ues_and_cells}
    ...                                          ELSE
    ...                                          sleep
    ...                                          ${STABILIZATION_TIME_BETWEEN_LINK_BREAKS}
    Check Detected Alarms
